  "description": "Spearfish C Deore Di2 is an endurance XC MTB built to cover as much ground as possible, no matter how challenging. Its light, responsive carbon fiber frame meshes perfectly with the efficiency of our Split Pivot suspension design for finely balanced pedaling and braking performance. 120mm of front and rear travel soaks up all the technical terrain you’ll find on your local loop, bikepacking race, and beyond. The geometry allows efficient pedaling for chasing FKTs, and grants a boost of confidence on terrain that wants to throw you off your game.\n\nSpearfish makes it easy to pack for big days out, with space for up to three bottles (sizes MD–XL), and cargo and accessory mounts that can also accommodate a sizeable direct-mount frame bag if that’s your jam. Shimano’s Deore Di2 groupset offers effortless, speedy electronic shifting so you can preserve every ounce of mental and physical energy as you push your limits.",
